## 4️⃣ LED Display (NeoPixel)

Instale o driver:

```bash
npm install neopixel
```

Crie `led-control.js`:

```js
// led-control.js
const NEOPIXEL = require('neopixel');
const ledPin = 5; // GPIO pin

let pixels = new NEOPIXEL(ledPin); // assume 1 channel

async function setup() {
  await new Promise(r => {
    // Initialize pins
    ledPin.write(pixels);
  });
  console.log('LEDs initialized');
}

setup();
```

No `server.js`, adicione:

```js
app.get('/led', (req, res) => {
  // Envia estado dos LEDs via WebSocket ou HTTP
  res.send(`Status: ${pixels.toString('hex')}`);
});
```

E no frontend, use `fetch('http://localhost:3000/led')`.

